  "label": "Maternal role limitations",
  "description": "The meme implicitly critiques Michelle Obama for not sharing photos of her pregnancy, which can be interpreted as a commentary on the expectations placed on mothers — particularly public figures — to document and share their personal experiences. This stereotype, that mothers should be 'on display' for public consumption, is a real-world social construct that the meme references.",
